%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8457553d7570b1146a94bd661e6d7528, type: 3}
  m_Name: Hearts and Minds Mission
  missionName: Hearts and Minds
  description: "Terror cells recruit where fear and grievance outrun trust in government. Restore average Order to at least 70 and deny extremists the social conditions they need to sustain operations."
  splashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e67fe310d73fd64fa9e6c6bbaa585bd, type: 3}
  victorySplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7855409ca574b0843837a05e7406abb7, type: 3}
  failureSplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d80c58872c1c2964790b26303a48bea1, type: 3}
  flavorText: "Terrorism survives on more than explosives and safe houses. It survives when citizens believe the state cannot protect them fairly, when neighborhoods expect abandonment, and when anger is easier to organize than cooperation. Security operations will continue, but this mission targets the deeper battlefield where legitimacy is won or lost. Services must function, abuses must be constrained, and ordinary people must see a future better than militancy. If we rebuild trust, recruitment dries up faster than any manhunt can keep pace."
  victoryFlavorText: "Order has stabilized across the affected regions, and support networks for terror cells are visibly weakening. Residents now report suspicious activity more often than they conceal it, and local institutions can act without immediate collapse of confidence. Violence may not disappear overnight, but its political oxygen is running out. Security was reinforced by legitimacy, not only by force."
  failureFlavorText: "Order never recovered to the required threshold, leaving extremist narratives more persuasive than government assurances. Communities most at risk remained distrustful, cooperation with authorities stayed thin, and recruitment pipelines continued feeding the cells. Tactical successes could not compensate for strategic alienation. The conflict persists because the social ground beneath it was never retaken."
  participantRole: 0
  strategyTags: 80
  objectives:
  - objectiveName: Hearts and Minds
    description: Restore average Order to at least 70.
    type: 36
    targetValue: 70
    targetMode: 0
    targetMultiplier: 1
    minimumTarget: 0
    maximumTarget: 0
  constraints: []
  rewardTiers:
  - tierName: Complete
    requiredObjectivesCompleted: 1
    rewardLegacy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d9e874baa19e41c6a256078ad8afd1d8, type: 2}
